  m_text: 'Got another Indonesian artifact! It was so, so shiny with pretty carvings...
    I LOVE how pretty it looked. Can totally understand how Mama fell in love with
    tham and wanted to share it with the world so badly.


    Also! Just realized
    how cool Mama was for being an Indonesian archeologist working abroad in the
    80s. I distinctly remember begging Mama to go with her on excavation trips but
    she would only take me to ones within the Netherlands...'
